# 12. Return-to-Project Procedure

If a new ChatGPT session is started:

1. Feed all six files in `docs/`.
2. Tell ChatGPT this is the Davison Financial Model project.
3. Tell it the current status is Sprint 4.9A complete, 4.9B pending Pi availability, and the latest full Windows test result is 137 passed.
4. If continuing Pi work, provide the latest project ZIP as well.
5. Ask ChatGPT to inspect the actual current source before changing anything.
6. Do not rely on memory for exact file contents.

The documents are intended to preserve enough context to resume deployment and testing without the original conversation.
